Note: MANUAL SMOKE (developer machine with mic):
Note:   $ dotnet run --project flow-interpreter tests/test_audio_in_pipeline.flow
Note: Expected: prints PASS sentinel + writes /tmp/test_audio_in.wav

use "@std"
use "@audio"

Note: 1-second mic capture with the locked -20 dB feedback guard applied.
Buffer mic = (micBuffer 1.0s)

Note: Granular texture — Phase 37 DSP-01 composes with mic input.
Buffer textured = (granular mic 50ms 20Hz 0.3)

Note: Write the textured capture out to disk.
(writeWav "/tmp/test_audio_in.wav" textured)

(print "PASS: audio-in pipeline composes with granular + writeWav")
